          "text": "An electronic spreadsheet is a software environment for organising data in rows and columns and performing calculations with that data. A spreadsheet can contain labels, numbers, formulas and functions. Because calculations can update automatically when source values change, spreadsheets are useful for budgets, marks, inventories, schedules, records and many other structured tasks."
